# T5-AE: register the startup log rotator on ApplicationStartingEvent so it fires before
# logback opens autobuilder.log / autobuilder.ndjson. A @Component bean wouldn't be
# instantiated in time — Spring's context doesn't exist yet at ApplicationStartingEvent.
org.springframework.context.ApplicationListener=\
  com.walpro.autobuilder.core.logging.StartupLogRotator
